#: includes/admin/class-admin-ui.php:185
msgid "Data sharing is off. Turn it on and WPOptimizing contributes only attribution metadata (names, sizes and how often things are seen — never values or content) to a shared dataset, and in return your site receives it, so plugins and options are identified far more accurately. It is reciprocal: while it is off, your site does not receive the shared dataset."
