msgstr "Heartbeat do WordPress"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:326
msgid "The admin Heartbeat fires admin-ajax every minute. Slowing or disabling it lowers PHP/DB load during active sessions."
msgstr "O Heartbeat do painel dispara admin-ajax a cada minuto. Abrandá-lo ou desativá-lo reduz a carga de PHP/BD durante as sessões ativas."

