#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:340
msgid "WP-Cron on visitor requests"
msgstr "WP-Cron nas visitas"

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:341
msgid "By default WordPress runs scheduled tasks during visits, which can add to TTFB. Define DISABLE_WP_CRON in wp-config.php and add a real system cron that hits wp-cron.php every few minutes. This needs server access, so WPOptimizing does not change it for you."
msgstr "Por predefinição o WordPress executa tarefas agendadas durante as visitas, o que pode aumentar o TTFB. Defina DISABLE_WP_CRON no wp-config.php e adicione um cron real do sistema que chame o wp-cron.php a cada poucos minutos. Isto requer acesso ao servidor, por isso o WPOptimizing não o altera por si."

#: includes/admin/trait-performance.php:343
